  "solution": "Decoding the given information :\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n P\n Q\n R\n S\n \n \n\n Means\n ×\n ÷\n -\n +\n \n \n\nNow check each option:\n\nOption 1) 13 R 5 S 2 P 6 P 3 S 24 R (44 P 2)\n\n13 - 5 + 2 × 6 × 3 + 24 - (44 × 2)\n\n→ 13 - 5 + __**2 × 6 × 3**__ + 24 - (44 × 2)\n\n→ 8 + 36 + 24 - 88\n\n→ 68 - 88 = -20\n\nNot equal to 75.\n\nOption 2) 13 P 5 S 2 P 6 Q 3 S 24 R (44 Q 2)\n\n13 × 5 + 2 × 6 ÷ 3 + 24 - (44 ÷ 2)\n\n→ 13 × 5 + __**2 × 6 ÷ 3**__ + 24 - (44 ÷ 2)\n\n→ 65 + 4 + 24 - 22\n\n→ 69 + 24 - 22\n\n→ 71\n\nNot equal to 75.\n\n**Option 3) 13 P 5 R 2 P 6 P 3 S 24 S (44 Q 2)**\n\n13 × 5 - 2 × 6 × 3 + 24 + (44 ÷ 2)\n\n→ 13 × 5 - __**2 × 6 × 3**__ + 24 + (44 ÷ 2)\n\n→ 65 - 36 + 24 + 22\n\n→ 75\n\nOption 4) 13 S 5 S 2 P 6 P 3 R 24 R (44 R 2)\n\n13 + 5 + 2 × 6 × 3 - 24 - (44 - 2)\n\n→ 13 + 5 + __**2 × 6 × 3**__ - 24 - (44 - 2)\n\n→ 18 + 36 - 24 - 42\n\n→ 30 - 42 = -12\n\nNot equal to 75.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
